        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Modify Safari storage quota based on WebKit resource]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40575</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40575"/>
        <updated>2025-08-04T19:42:15.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112591951?u=83251e0d8e8f801faef99cc68533e148a728784b&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">Corrects the Safari origin and overall storage quota values to match WebKit’s official policy and clarifies the distinction between browser apps, web apps, and non-browser WebViews, just as requested in the issue.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">As stated in the issue, the current numbers in the MDN documentation for Safari’s per-origin quota (20% vs 60%) and overall quota (15% vs 80%) were inverted and the role of WebViews versus standalone web apps was unclear. Updating these values ensures MDN reflects the current WebKit storage policy and prevents developers from planning around incorrect limits.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<p dir="auto">The issue referenced pull request <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1846151273" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/28510" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/28510/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/28510">#28510</a>, which uses the Webkit article and has the numbers flipped.<br>
WebKit article: <a href="https://www.webkit.org/blog/14403/updates-to-storage-policy/" rel="nofollow">https://www.webkit.org/blog/14403/updates-to-storage-policy/</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #40394.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3237705756" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40394" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/40394/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40394">#40394</a></p>



]]></content>
